From: Silt OS maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] dash: avoid redefining fallback glob flag

Silt uses dash's internal pathname expansion rather than libc glob. The fallback
header already defines GLOB_ALTDIRFUNC, so clear it before selecting the
non-glibc value used by expand.c.

--- a/src/expand.c
+++ b/src/expand.c
@@ -1475,2 +1475,3 @@
 #else
+#undef GLOB_ALTDIRFUNC
 #define GLOB_ALTDIRFUNC 0
